From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{recons|standanan|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{recons|steh₂-|lang=ine-pro}}.  Cognate with Old Frisian [[standa]], Old High German [[stantan]], Old Saxon [[standan#Old Saxon|standan]], Old Norse [[standa]], Gothic [[𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽𐌳𐌰𐌽]].  The Germanic source is cognate with Greek {{l|grc|ἵστημι}}, Latin [[stare]], Old Irish [[tairissiur]], Old Slavic ''stojati'' (Russian [[стоять]]).

